## Checklist for New Code

When creating new code, verify:

- [ ] Model created → Test file in `src/models/__tests__/{Model}.test.js`
- [ ] Repository created → Test file in `src/repositories/__tests__/{repository}Repository.test.js`
- [ ] Service created → Test file in `src/services/__tests__/{service}Service.test.js`
- [ ] Middleware created → Test file in `src/middleware/__tests__/{middleware}.test.js`
- [ ] Controller created → Test file in `src/modules/{module}/__tests__/{module}Controller.test.js`
- [ ] Module with API → Integration test in `src/modules/__tests__/{module}.integration.test.js`
- [ ] Utility created → Test file in `src/utils/__tests__/{utility}.test.js`

